Open DeepSeek Harness with a model

Usage: wally deepseek [OPTIONS] [args...]

Arguments:
  args                        Passed through to the tool

Options:
  -h, --help                  Show help
  -m, --model TEXT            A model on this machine, or a hosted one from your
                              account
      --hybrid                Route the parent to the cloud and subagents to a
                              local model
      --cloud-model TEXT      The cloud model the parent lane uses (defaults to
                              your default model)

Examples:
  # Download the certified local model once
  wally models pull qwen3-4b-instruct-2507

  # Start the tool with the certified local model
  wally deepseek -m qwen3-4b-instruct-2507

  # Use a cloud model after wally account login
  wally deepseek -m glm-5.3-flash
